  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_flask_cb17a15a0a45d6584990005d8c2cc022da98e763fd3ff932e6676e6617cb8c20cb2">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Spheroidal, bulbous shape, pear-shaped, or flattened vessels with a narrow neck and a small mouth, usually of glass, ceramic, metal, animal skin, wicker, or another material and used for various purposes. Also used specifically for distinctive narrow-necked vessels, usually of glass, having a rounded body, used in laboratories. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
